WEBVTT

00:00:00.476 --> 00:00:01.185
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:04.710
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> It started to rain as soon as we left.

00:00:06.688 --> 00:00:07.258
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.281 --> 00:00:10.132
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I really don’t know what to do.

00:00:12.195 --> 00:00:12.852
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:13.875 --> 00:00:17.292
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> She learned to swim when she was very young.

00:00:19.289 --> 00:00:19.935
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:20.898 --> 00:00:22.875
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> He told us not to come tonight.

00:00:24.852 --> 00:00:25.593
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:26.615 --> 00:00:28.356
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Do you want to send Tom a card?

00:00:30.353 --> 00:00:31.120
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:32.441 --> 00:00:35.008
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I think I forgot to turn my phone off.